# Brant Business Interiors

> Brant Business Interiors is a family-owned commercial office furniture dealership in Peterborough, Ontario, serving businesses and public-sector organizations across Ontario since 1964. It is the commercial office furniture operating brand of Office Central Inc., registered under our parent legal entity, Brant Basics, as an authorized OECM Supplier Partner. Brant Business Interiors supplies, delivers, and installs commercial-grade office furniture for businesses, clinics, law firms, and public-sector buyers. It is not a retail office-supplies store, and it does not sell used or refurbished furniture.

