## What we are
Brant Business Interiors is a commercial office furniture dealer. Categories include seating, desks and workstations, storage and filing, tables, boardroom, ergonomic products, and related lines, sold to businesses, clinics, law firms, and public-sector buyers. Brant Business Interiors is not a consumer office-supplies retailer, and does not sell used or refurbished furniture.

## Authorized brands carried
Global Furniture Group, OTG (Offices to Go), Teknion, Humanscale, Keilhauer, ergoCentric, Heartwood, ObusForme, Safco, FireKing, and Office Star.

